  "caveats": [
    "Standalone factorial diagnostic, not model throughput, long-context performance or physical bus counters.",
    "All16 GDN launches are fixed; slot count changes data reuse, optional advance changes kernel/GRF transitions and adds work/barriers.",
    "The surrogate advance is not a Strata projection; its 64 counters validate every extra launch, including conditioning and warmups.",
    "GDN n_keep=null,t_out_begin0: state read-only verification, not commit/replay.",
    "Two overwritten phases, each200ms conditioning+10warmups+30retained; clocks unlocked.",
    "Raw GPU time uses calibrated19.2MHz/36bit CS domain; two timestamp writes add fixed overhead.",
    "Allocation implementations differ; requested host/local placement is not continuously observed.",
